[TITLE]
API-06: reservoir R1 feeds a chain of three junctions; the test adds a pipe from J3 to J3

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID   Elev  Demand
 J1   0     50
 J2   0     50
 J3   0     50

[RESERVOIRS]
;ID   Head
 R1   100

[PIPES]
;ID  N1  N2  Length  Diam  Rough  Mloss  Status
 P1  R1  J1  1000    12    100    0      Open
 P2  J1  J2  1000    12    100    0      Open
 P3  J2  J3  1000    12    100    0      Open

[OPTIONS]
 Units      GPM
 Headloss   H-W

[END]
